The '''Star-Time Cosmetic Pack''' is an active [[Gamepass]] featuring 5 exclusive skins regarding the {{Type|Mains}} (excluding Holiday Mains) in [[Dandy's World]]. It was introduced in [[Changelog|v0.4.1]] as the first gamepass available in [[Dandy's Store]] and [[Dyle's Store]].

==Effect==
Players who purchased this gamepass are rewarded 600 [[Ichor]] and receive the 5 matching skins for {{CI|Astro|name=true}}, {{CI|Shelly|name=true}}, {{CI|Vee|name=true}}, {{CI|Sprout|name=true}}, and {{CI|Pebble|name=true}}.

== Description ==
This gamepass features 5 exclusive skins for: Astro, Pebble, Sprout, Shelly and Vee! These skins feature unique particles, trails and ability effects. All features are cosmetic and do not effect gameplay.

==Previous Effect==
Before Skin Tickets were changed from RNG to direct purchases, this [[Gamepass]] allowed the buyer to Auto Buy [[Skins]], and speed up the animation as well. After countries like Australia were given new laws stating that random-chance gambling was not allowed for minors within their country, Skin Tickets were updated to the current version, thus making this Gamepass effectively useless. As compensation, the developers granted the people who had bought the Gamepass 600 [[Ichor]] and the Star-Time Cosmetic Pack, and changed the Gamepass to instead grant the aforementioned rewards.

